From da4dad4c50d9350da383d3395ce4dd42fb770560 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Meson Codec <meson-codec@localhost>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 11:18:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: meson: add V4L2 M2M HCODEC encoder scaffold

Add stateful V4L2 M2M queue and format plumbing for linear NV12 to H.264.
The driver binds only to the parent-created encoder child and participates
in shared DOS arbitration. Hardware execution remains deliberately disabled
and returns jobs as errors until the firmware backend is implemented.

Signed-off-by: Meson Codec <meson-codec@localhost>
