+config VIDEO_MESON_VENC
+	tristate "Amlogic Meson H.264 encoder scaffold"
+	depends on VIDEO_DEV
+	depends on VIDEO_MESON_VDEC
+	depends on ARCH_MESON || COMPILE_TEST
+	select V4L2_MEM2MEM_DEV
+	select VIDEOBUF2_DMA_CONTIG
+	help
+	  Build the V4L2 memory-to-memory encoder framework for the HCODEC
+	  block found in Amlogic Meson GXL and GXM SoCs.
+
+	  The initial implementation provides format negotiation, videobuf2 queue
+	  plumbing and shared DOS resource arbitration with meson-vdec. Hardware
+	  execution remains disabled until the HCODEC backend is implemented.
